# Production env for the candidate site (apps/web) on Vercel → interviehire.com
# Set these in the Vercel project's Environment Variables (Production scope).

# The hosted Fastify engine on Render (sessions + transcript + report + WS).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://interviehire-engine.onrender.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=wss://interviehire-engine.onrender.com/ws

# No NEXT_PUBLIC_LIVEKIT_* secret is required for per-job conversational
# interviews. LiveKit connection details and the room-scoped participant token
# are minted by the Fastify engine (LIVEKIT_URL/API_KEY/API_SECRET there).

# The interview room uses its built-in animated AI orb / LiveKit voice
# visualizer. No avatar URL, GPU streamer, Cloudflare tunnel, or additional
# environment variable is required.
